{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Mystery \u2013 Darkvale Motel is a first-person horror adventure blending police investigation, exploration, and psychological suspense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016820/extras/7e088094228cb3546bf74e0eb0c2ffc0.poster.avif?t=1768298067\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016820/extras/7e088094228cb3546bf74e0eb0c2ffc0.webm?t=1768298067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Miles McDaniel, a police officer sent with his partner to the Darkvale Motel to investigate the disturbing disappearance of a resident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple missing-person case soon spirals into a descent through the darkest corners of the Darkvale Forest. By searching the motel rooms, questioning its occupants, and piecing together clues, you gradually uncover a reality far more terrifying than expected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a first-person exploration and investigation simulator. Players search the environment, interact with residents, and collect evidence to advance the narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually escalating psychological and horror atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed exploration of the Darkvale Motel and surrounding forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock-picking mechanics to access restricted areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phone and computer hacking mechanics to uncover residents\u2019 hidden truths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with clues, documents, and newspapers to solve the mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design and visual effects that heighten tension</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016820?t=1768298067","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016820/a71231bad0667cc73a7c0159b2db9f6f6936e1a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768298067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016820/7feaaf3d78ede6887d79814a3177266f30b5f5e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768298067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016820/7feaaf3d78ede6887d79814a3177266f30b5f5e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768298067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Echoes of Mystery \u2013 Darkvale Motel contains scenes of intense and bloody violence, including gunfights and melee combat. Some areas also feature corpses and bloody elements, as well as references to past criminal acts.\r\nThe atmosphere is tense and psychologically frightening, with dark environments. The game contains mild language, but no sexual content or nudity."},"demos":[{"appid":4154750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Mystery \u2013 Darkvale Motel is a first-person horror adventure blending police investigation, exploration, and psychological suspense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016820/extras/7e088094228cb3546bf74e0eb0c2ffc0.poster.avif?t=1768298067\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016820/extras/7e088094228cb3546bf74e0eb0c2ffc0.webm?t=1768298067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Miles McDaniel, a police officer sent with his partner to the Darkvale Motel to investigate the disturbing disappearance of a resident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple missing-person case soon spirals into a descent through the darkest corners of the Darkvale Forest. By searching the motel rooms, questioning its occupants, and piecing together clues, you gradually uncover a reality far more terrifying than expected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a first-person exploration and investigation simulator. Players search the environment, interact with residents, and collect evidence to advance the narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually escalating psychological and horror atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed exploration of the Darkvale Motel and surrounding forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock-picking mechanics to access restricted areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phone and computer hacking mechanics to uncover residents\u2019 hidden truths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with clues, documents, and newspapers to solve the mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design and visual effects that heighten tension</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sifar Production"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016820/5b004dcc0fdec9ea4ade0abdbc0bcfb3db8799b4/header.jpg?t=1768298067","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/40